     NovoPen 6 / Echo Plus (inv. 29, docs/29-novopen.md): an NFC Forum Type 4 tag, but Android's NDEF check times out on
     it (NFA_NDEF_DETECT_EVT 0xB2 on the user's Pixel, 0.11.45), so it is dispatched as IsoDep + NfcA without Ndef. This
     list therefore also matches bank / transit cards and passports: pen/PenReadActivity finishes silently for any tag
     that doesn't answer the pen's application selection (no card, no vibration). The Libre sensor (NfcV) never matches. -->
<resources xmlns:xliff="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2">
    <tech-list>
        <tech>android.nfc.tech.IsoDep</tech>
        <tech>android.nfc.tech.NfcA</tech>
    </tech-list>
</resources>
